  "ruleText": "Saf-C 4905.03 Issuance of Renewal Certificate. An applicant who meets the re-certification requirements, pursuant to Saf-C 4905.02, shall be issued a new pocket card and wall certificate.\n\nSource. #8650, eff 6-2-06",
